{"baseRefOid":"efd29c05204703acca9a0860812f54b94fae54b1","body":"Original unrestricted line-arrangement conjecture remains unsolved after five substantive turns. This draft preserves all 36 frozen author files and eight independent-review files, plus two additive publication guides.\n\nScoped results: an effective-coordinate finite-kernel algorithm when r<k²; the credited Hesse value with an auxiliary-line cover; all two-line extensions of supersolvable arrangements; Fermat deletion resilience; and an infinite 9q-line family with exact Seshadri constant 1/(4q+1). The source maximum is over all projective lines. The final dual proves only the component-cover optimum 4q, not optimality over arbitrary auxiliary lines.\n\nIndependent full scoped PASS: 214,070 author assertions and 93,918 independent controls replay exactly. Source report year2019 and publication date19November2020 are distinguished. Classical results are credited; no novelty or human peer-review claim.\n\nFresh main is first parent and frozen author WIP is second parent. Only this target folder and its own QUEUE status/turn cells changed. Python3 and SymPy are required. Public checkout replay passes with source_files_checked=0, explicitly omitting raw PDF/screenshot hashes; exact sources can be supplied separately. No raw source imports, private notes, merge or release.","files":[{"path":"problems/30004322_arrangement_seshadri/FINAL_AUTHOR_MANIFEST.json","additions":182,"deletions":0},{"path":"problems/30004322_arrangement_seshadri/FINAL_RESULT.md","additions":11,"deletions":0},{"path":"problems/30004322_arrangement_seshadri/FINAL_REVIEW_REQUEST.md","additions":9,"deletions":0},{"path":"problems/30004322_arrangement_seshadri/PUBLICATION_SCOPE.json","additions":12,"deletions":0},{"path":"problems/30004322_arrangement_seshadri/README_PUBLICATION.md","additions":18,"deletions":0},{"path":"problems/30004322_arrangement_seshadri/REPLAY_ALL.py","additions":16,"deletions":0},{"path":"problems/30004322_arrangem